    "## 🏪 1. Shopping Cart System\n",
    "\n",
    "### Goal:\n",
    "    Create a shopping cart program that allows users to add items to their cart.\n",
    "    Stop adding items when the user types \"done\".\n",
    "\n",
    "### Steps:\n",
    "\n",
    "    Ask the user to enter product names.\n",
    "    \n",
    "    Add each item to a list.\n",
